The Holy of holies shall it be , just as what is offered on behalf of sin and of transgression .
This shall be an everlasting ordinance in your generations concerning the sacrifices of the Lord .
They shall offer a tenth part of an ephah of fine wheat flour as a perpetual sacrifice , half of it in the morning , and half of it in the evening .
And it shall be entirely burned on the altar .
In the place where the holocaust is offered , it shall be immolated in the sight of the Lord .
If a garment will be sprinkled with its blood , it shall be washed in a holy place .
But if the vessel will be of brass , it shall be scoured and washed with water .
6:30 For the victim that is slain for sin , whose blood is carried into the tabernacle of the testimony , for expiation in the Sanctuary , shall not be eaten , but it shall be consumed by fire .
7:1 Likewise , this is the law of the sacrifice for a transgression .
7:2 Therefore , where the holocaust is immolated , the victim for a transgression shall also be slain .
