19:12 You shall not commit perjury in my name , nor shall you pollute the name of your God .
19:13 You shall not slander your neighbor , nor shall you oppress him by violence .
19:14 You shall not speak evil of the deaf , nor shall you place a stumbling block before the blind , but you shall fear the Lord your God , for I am the Lord .
19:18 Do not seek revenge , neither should you be mindful of the injury of your fellow citizens .
