A relic is either the bodily remains of a saint , or an object that belonged to a saint or touched ( or was touched ) by Jesus or a saint .
While devotion to relics may seem strange to non-Catholics , it is in fact a thoroughly biblical practice .
The veneration of relics , moreover , points to the bodily resurrection promised to the followers of Christ ( see , again , the Letter to the Romans , 8:21).
The Church also teaches that God’s grace may be received through the body of a holy man or woman because it has been consecrated to God , and there is a strong biblical precedent for this .
In the Second Book of Kings , a dead man is resurrected when his body comes into contact with the bones of the Prophet Elisha (13:21), and in the New Testament , the followers of Saint John the Baptist come for his body after he is put to death by Herod ( see Matthew 14:12).
From the historical record , we learn that around the year 156 the Christians in Smyrna gathered up the charred bones of their martyred Bishop , Polycarp , who had been a disciple of the Apostle John .
This practice has been maintained by the faithful of all generations .
Acknowledging man was created with a body as well as a soul , the Church does not denigrate the physical world , but raises it up to God for renewal ( see Paul’s First Letter to the Corinthians , 6:19-20).
Other instances of material things used in Scripture as channels of grace include :
So , the souls of those who have died in friendship with God are not “asleep” in the grave , but rule with Him in heaven .
The body remains on earth for a time while the soul enters into eternity .
P :1 And it happened that , after Israel was driven into captivity , and Jerusalem was deserted ,
The Governess of the Gentiles has become like a widow .
There is no one to be a comfort to her and to all her beloved .
She has lived among the nations and not found rest .
All her gates are destroyed .
Her virgins are filthy .
Jerusalem has remembered the days of her affliction and the betrayal of all her desirable ones , whom she held from the days of antiquity , when her people fell into the hand of the enemy , and there was no one to be a helper .
Because of this , she has become unstable .
Then she groaned and turned away again .
Her filth is on her feet , and her end has not been remembered .
O Lord , look upon my affliction , for the adversary has been lifted up .
They have given up whatever was precious in exchange for food , so as to remain alive .
For he has made me a vintage , just as the Lord has spoken in the day of his furious anger .
From on high , he has sent fire into my bones , and he has educated me .
He has placed me in desolation , consumed by grief , all day long .
He has called forth time against me , so as to crush my elect ones .
For the consoler has been far away from me , changing my soul .
The Lord has given orders against Jacob ; his enemies are all around him .
I beg all people to listen and to see my sorrow .
My priests and my elders have been consumed in the city .
My bowels have been disturbed , my heart has been subverted within me , for I am filled with bitterness .
All my enemies have heard of my misfortune ; they have rejoiced that you caused it .
O how the Lord has covered the daughter of Zion with gloom in his fury !
In his fury , he has destroyed the fortifications of the virgin of Judah , and he has thrown them down to the ground .
He has drawn back his right hand before the face of the enemy .
He has fixed his right hand like an adversary .
He has poured out his indignation like fire .
The Lord has become like an enemy .
He has thrown down all of his defenses .
And he has torn apart her tent like a garden .
In Zion , the Lord has delivered feast and Sabbath into oblivion , and king and priest into disgrace , and into the indignation of his fury .
The Lord has pushed away his own altar .
He has delivered the walls of its towers into the hand of the enemy .
He has stretched out his measuring line , and he has not turn away his hand from perdition .
The elders of the daughter of Zion have become idle ; they sit on the ground .
To what shall I equate you , so as to console you , O virgin daughter of Zion ?
Who will cure you ?
Your prophets have seen false and foolish things for you .
All those who passed by the way have clapped their hands over you .
The Lord has done what he decided to do .
Let tears run down like a torrent throughout the day and the night .
Give praise in the night , in the first of the watches .
Lift up your hands to him on behalf of the souls of your little ones , who have passed away from famine at the head of all the crossroads .
O Lord , see and consider those whom you have made into a such vintage .
Shall priest and prophet be killed in the sanctuary of the Lord ?
The boy and the old man lie down on the ground outside .
I am a man watching my own poverty by the rod of his indignation .
He has driven me and led me into darkness , and not into light .
Against me only , he has turned and turned again his hand , all day long .
My skin and my flesh , he has made old ; he has crushed my bones .
He has built all around me , and he has encircled me with gall and hardship .
He has gathered me into darkness , like those who are forever dead .
He has built against me all around , so that I may not depart .
He has placed me in desolation .
He has bent his bow , and he has positioned me like a target for his arrows .
I have become a derision to all my people , their song throughout the day .
And he has broken each one of my teeth ; he has fed me with ashes .
And my soul has been driven away from peace ; I have forgotten what is good .
And I said , “My end and my hope from the Lord has perished.”
I will call to mind the past , and my soul shall languish within me .
These recollections are in my heart ; therefore , I shall hope .
By the mercies of the Lord , we are not consumed .
Because of this , I will wait for him .
The Lord is good to those who hope in him , to the soul that seeks him .
It is good to stand ready in silence for the salvation of God .
It is good for a man , when he has carried the yoke from his youth .
About this , you are relentless .
You have covered us in your fury , and you have struck us .
I called upon your name , O Lord , from the furthest pit .
You have heard my voice .
Judge my case .
You have seen all their fury , every one of their thoughts is against me .
You have heard their reproach , O Lord , all their thoughts are against me .
Watch their sitting down and their rising up : I am their psalm .
You shall give them a heavy shield of the heart : your hardship .
But the daughter of my people is cruel , like the ostrich in the desert .
The tongue of the infant adheres to his palate out of thirst .
And the iniquity of the daughter of my people has been made greater than the sin of Sodom , which was overthrown in a moment , and yet hands did not take captives in her .
Her Nazirites were whiter than snow , shinier than milk , more ruddy than ancient ivory , more beautiful than sapphire .
The hands of pitiable women have boiled their sons .
The kings of the earth , and all the inhabitants of the world , did not believe that the adversary and the enemy would enter through the gates of Jerusalem .
It is because of the sins of her prophets , and the iniquities of her priests , who have shed the blood of the just in her midst .
They have wandered in the streets like the blind ; they have been defiled with blood .
” Of course , they argued , and being removed , they said among the Gentiles , “He will no longer dwell among them.”
The face of the Lord has divided them .
They were not ashamed before the faces of the priests , nor did they take pity on the elderly .
While we were still standing , our eyes failed , expecting help for us in vain , when we looked attentively toward a nation that was not able to save .
Our footsteps have slipped on the paths of our own streets .
Our days have been completed , for our end has arrived .
Your iniquity has been completed , O daughter of Zion .
He has visited your iniquity , O daughter of Edom ; he has uncovered your sins .
