And they stood still at the watch gate .
And the singers were singing clearly , and Jezrahiah was their foremost leader .
And the rejoicing of Jerusalem was heard from far away .
For Judah was rejoicing in the priests and the Levites who were assisting .
12:45 For in the days of David and Asaph , from the beginning , there were leaders appointed over the singers , to give praise in verses , and to confess to God .
