” And I gathered them together , and I caused them to stand at their stations .
13:13 And we appointed over the storehouses , Shelemiah , the priest , and Zadok , the scribe , and Pedaiah from the Levites , and next to them Hanan , the son of Zaccur , the son of Mattaniah .
