For you have hewn a sepulcher for yourself here .
22:17 Behold , the Lord will cause you to be carried away , like a domesticated rooster , and he will remove you , like an outer garment .
22:19 And I will expel you from your station , and I will depose you from your ministry .
22:21 And I will clothe him with your vestment , and I will strengthen him with your belt , and I will give your authority to his hand .
22:22 And I will place the key of the house of David upon his shoulder .
And when he closes , no one will open .
And he will be upon a throne of glory in the house of his father .
The merchants of Sidon , crossing over the sea , have filled you .
The harvest of the river is her crop .
Her feet will lead her to a sojourn far away .
